OL,3,GNEWSA'My girl lost her limbs to
OL,4,Ameningitis - get the jab'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a girl who lost all her
OL,7,Flimbs to meningitis is urging young
OL,8,Fpeople to get vaccinated, as figures
OL,9,Fshow many still have not had the jab.
OL,11,FHarmonie-Rose, from Bath, was just 10
OL,12,Fmonths old when she contracted
OL,13,Fmeningococcal septicaemia in 2014. She
OL,14,Fspent four months in intensive care and
OL,15,Fwas given a 10% chance of survival.
OL,17,FThe latest figures show 53,000 young
OL,18,Fpeople in the South West who qualify
OL,19,Ffor the Meningitis B vaccine are yet to
OL,20,Fhave their first dose.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
