OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'My girl lost her limbs to
OL,4,Ameningitis - get the jab'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You always think it won't be you but
OL,7,Fwe thought that too," said Harmonie's
OL,8,Fmum Freya. "Vaccination is one of the
OL,9,Fbest defences we have against this
OL,10,Fdisease so if you or your child is
OL,11,Feligible, please don't put it off."
